COMPILATION OF: E39X2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   2 b         declare a fixed, 1 g, 2 a fixed, 2 b fixed;
DUPLIC                                 ?
    1 ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   2 c         declare a fixed, 1 g, 2 a fixed, 2 b fixed;
QUALIFY                ?
   3 c         a = 3;
QUALIFY          ?
   5 c         put list(a);
QUALIFY                  ?
    3 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E39X2

   1 a 0000 b9w: procedure options(main);
   2 c 0006    declare a fixed, 1 g, 2 a fixed, 2 b fixed;
   3 c 0006    a = 3;
   4 c 0012    g.a = 8;
   5 c 001D    put list(a);
   6 c 0034   stop;
   7 a 0037 end b9w;

